---
import LegalLayout from '../../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import {
	LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL,
	LICENSE_PATH,
	PRIVACY_PATH,
	SITE_BRAND,
	TERMS_PATH,
} from '../../lib/seo';
---

<LegalLayout
	title="About"
	description="About iStockVisual: a stock library of photos, illustrations, vectors, and 3D, plus in-browser studio tools."
	heading="About iStockVisual"
	lede="iStockVisual is a stock-visual library and a set of browser tools for campaigns, products, and everyday design work."
>
	<h2>1. What we are</h2>
	<p>
		{SITE_BRAND} publishes photos, illustrations, vectors, and 3D stills you can search, filter, and
		download. Most library images are generated or prepared for this site. They are licensed for use
		— they are not public domain, and a download does not transfer copyright.
	</p>
	<p>
		Beside the library we run in-browser studio tools: an image editor, format conversion,
		vectorizing, social resizing, batch watermarking, and a palette generator. Those tools process
		files in your browser. Files you pick from your device are not uploaded to iStockVisual unless a
		feature clearly says otherwise (visual search is the exception, and those query photos are
		deleted after a short period).
	</p>

	<h2>2. How downloads work</h2>
	<p>
		500 and 1K sizes are free. 2K, 4K, and 8K files need an active Pro plan or pass. Every size uses
		the same <a href={LICENSE_PATH}>Content License</a>: commercial and personal use are allowed, and
		attribution is required. Credit wording equivalent to <strong>Generated by {SITE_BRAND}</strong>
		{' '}is enough; a link back to the image page is preferred when the medium allows it.
	</p>
	<p>
		Accounts, fair-use limits, and paid plans are described in the
		<a href={TERMS_PATH}>Terms of Use</a>. How we handle account data and short-lived search uploads
		is in the <a href={PRIVACY_PATH}>Privacy Policy</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>3. How the library is organized</h2>
	<p>
		You can browse by media type (photos, illustrations, vectors, 3D), by topical category, or by
		search. Filters cover orientation, color (matched against each image’s palette), excluded
		keywords, and sort order. Related keywords appear on search result pages so you can jump to a
		nearby query.
	</p>

	<h2>4. Hosting</h2>
	<p>
		The site runs on Cloudflare. Account records live in Cloudflare D1. Library files and brief
		visual-search uploads live in Cloudflare R2. We aim to keep the catalog useful and the tools
		fast; listings and available sizes can change as assets are added or retired.
	</p>

	<h2>5. Contact</h2>
	<p>
		Questions about the library, a plan, or these pages:
		<a href={`mailto:${LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{LEGAL_CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
	</p>
</LegalLayout>
